sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant LC as Lifecycle (Ch 44)
    participant Conn as RealtimeConnection
    participant WS as Server WSS
    participant SSOT as Room (Ch 3)

    User->>LC: open chat (foreground)
    LC->>Conn: connect (authed handshake, Ch 19)
    Conn->>WS: upgrade + token + resume cursor
    WS-->>Conn: connected (+ replay missed since cursor, Ch 32)
    loop live
        WS-->>Conn: message (seq n)
        Conn->>SSOT: idempotent upsert (dedupe by seq, Ch 15)
        Conn->>Conn: ping-pong heartbeat
    end
    WS--xConn: connection drops
    Conn->>Conn: jittered backoff (Ch 2)
    Conn->>WS: reconnect + resume cursor -> replay missed
